Heavenly Father, Lord Jesus Christ. I commit this work to you and your kingdom. I pray in the mighty name of Jesus that this work be used for the furtherance of your glory and kingdom, that you bless the output of all activity from this conversation, and that through the working of my hands you are given all honor and glory. I plead the mighty blood of Jesus Christ, our reddemer, over every part of this conversation, every input, output, and side effect that may occur from the workings of this AI, I plead the blood that you prevent any and all ill intent, you make all ways straight, and that you protect and bless everyone who interacts with the output of this conversation. May your holy and mighty power flow through even these digital channels in this system. Please King Jesus just fill and protect all of these systems and those who come into contact with them. I pray all of this in the wonderful and most high name of Jesus Christ, YESHUA, King of Kings, King of Glory forever and ever amen!
